{'symbol': 'AVB', 'date': '2023-03-03 16:15:00', 'title': 'AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. PROVIDES FIRST QUARTER 2023 OPERATING UPDATE AND PUBLISHES INVESTOR PRESENTATION', 'text': "ARLINGTON, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. (NYSE: AVB) (THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT SAME STORE RESIDENTIAL RENTAL REVENUE FOR THE TWO MONTHS ENDED FEBRUARY 28, 2023, INCREASED 10.5% OVER THE PRIOR YEAR PERIOD. THIS IS CONSISTENT WITH THE COMPANY'S EXPECTATION FOR SAME STORE RESIDENTIAL RENTAL REVENUE GROWTH FOR THIS TWO-MONTH PERIOD WHEN THE COMPANY PUBLISHED ITS OUTLOOK FOR FULL YEAR 2023 SAME STORE RESIDENTIAL RENTAL REVENUE GROWTH ON FEBRUARY 8, 2023."}